        <mxCell id="p05_note" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10px 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#B45309;margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;Senior Engineer Note&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Ledger and snapshot tables are append-only; mutable projections are portfolio_positions and cash_balances. AUM snapshots use polymorphic scope_type/scope_id instead of two hard FKs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=7;shadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
